From 1434c7b8338ed1fb094ed604c341a8583db1e607 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 10:44:39 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18d: discard browser-less documents while
 preserving tabs

Enable the guarded preserving WebContents discard path for embedded startup, retain navigation/helpers/leases and reload on presentation or activation. Emit additive discard state event kinds, cancel document work, and exclude non-tab pages from TabHandle-only discard notifications. ABI 1.25 / bridge 0.27.0; build p68, repeated native discard/reload, boost/history/identity/sibling preservation, cancellation, shutdown and explicit feature disable pass.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
